{"3520620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Computer Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 3520620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your own computer store. A place where customers browse the latest tech, PCs need fixing, and LAN parties keep the shop buzzing long after closing time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, organize, and manage your store at your own pace as you turn a small shop into a lively tech hub for gamers and hardware enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ RUN YOUR STORE, YOUR WAY ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock shelves with gadgets, manage pricing, and keep your customers moving through the store. Every day brings small decisions that shape how your shop runs, from layout and inventory to staffing and customer flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ REPAIR, UPGRADE, AND BUILD PCS ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on hands-on repair jobs and PC upgrades. Swap components, fix issues, and build custom systems for customers who want the latest and greatest hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ HOST LAN PARTIES AND EVENTS ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up LAN stations, host gaming events, and give customers a reason to stick around. LAN parties bring energy to your store and turn it into a social space, not just a place to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ GROW AND UPGRADE YOUR STORE ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new furniture, equipment, and features as your store grows. Rearrange your layout, expand your offerings, and shape the shop into the tech space you want it to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wishlist and follow to stay up to date on development, features, and upcoming updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=474 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your own computer store. A place where customers browse the latest tech, PCs need fixing, and LAN parties keep the shop buzzing long after closing time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, organize, and manage your store at your own pace as you turn a small shop into a lively tech hub for gamers and hardware enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/17de48777336acd6b16b486b68214c01.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ RUN YOUR STORE, YOUR WAY ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock shelves with gadgets, manage pricing, and keep your customers moving through the store. Every day brings small decisions that shape how your shop runs, from layout and inventory to staffing and customer flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/778a7cf84838e9dd276a3dcb43d8ca6a.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ REPAIR, UPGRADE, AND BUILD PCS ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on hands-on repair jobs and PC upgrades. Swap components, fix issues, and build custom systems for customers who want the latest and greatest hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/b0bfe9e056df75cae74b73e303e118d3.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ HOST LAN PARTIES AND EVENTS ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up LAN stations, host gaming events, and give customers a reason to stick around. LAN parties bring energy to your store and turn it into a social space, not just a place to shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/51eaf2572533262c1a8bcaf94010a3cc.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">══ GROW AND UPGRADE YOUR STORE ══</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new furniture, equipment, and features as your store grows. Rearrange your layout, expand your offerings, and shape the shop into the tech space you want it to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/237714a30646d436db9045f2bf413ec1.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wishlist and follow to stay up to date on development, features, and upcoming updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.poster.avif?t=1766792964\" width=474 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.webm?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/extras/cc9ab2a6014944977415b2ea667bf081.mp4?t=1766792964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Manage your own computer store and grow it from a small shop into a bustling tech hub. Sell gadgets, repair PCs, hire employees, and host epic LAN parties as you expand and upgrade your store!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/2ef7ed9fe9aee0e19d78676d84a650c822170e68/header.jpg?t=1766792964", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520620/bfac689381bba09ca4ca934ea27cbedb187d0ee0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=176